Package: rtl8761bu-firmware
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-firmware
Description: Updated Realtek RTL8761BU Bluetooth 5.4 firmware (0xddd5c761)
 Official Realtek RTL8761BU / RTL8761BUV USB Bluetooth 5.4 firmware
 (fw version 0xddd5c761, extracted from Windows WHQL driver 1.9.1038.3023).
 .
 Fixes the Xbox Wireless Controller (Series X|S) Bluetooth Low Energy
 disconnect loop caused by the May 2023 0xdfc6d922 regression in
 linux-firmware on adapters such as the TP-Link UB500 (2357:0604),
 UB500 Plus, Mercusys MA530, and ASUS USB-BT500, while upgrading the
 adapter from Bluetooth 5.1 to Bluetooth 5.4.
 .
 Installs into /usr/lib/firmware/updates/rtl_bt/ so it takes priority
 over linux-firmware without package file conflicts on Ubuntu and Kubuntu.
